Add build stamp to battle screen + cache-clear on stuck load screen

- Show BUILD_LABEL in the battle top bar (lg+) so the running build is
  always identifiable even mid-match.
- "Initializing battlefield..." now shows the build stamp and a
  "Clear cache & reload" button, so a player stuck on the grid can
  recover without navigating to Settings.
- New build stamp: BUILD 20261124-1839 (cacheId wrt-20261124183900).